<title>USA: Advanced Materials repurchases shares.</title>
<headline>Advanced Materials repurchases shares.</headline>
<dateline>RANCHO DOMINGUEZ, Calif 1997-07-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Advanced Materials Group has repurchased 2 million shares of common stock from its majority shareholder, Trilon Dominion Partners LLC for $1.75 per share.</p>
<p>The closing bid price for the company's stock on July 22, 1997 was $2.03 per share. The transaction was funded primarily with available cash.</p>
<p>Trilon Dominion remains the company's largest shareholder, as a beneficial owner with 1.6 million of the now 8.5 million total shares outstanding. Trilon Dominion's chief executive officer, Robert W. Cantwell, is a continuing director of the company.</p>
</text>
